    96	/// this off the actual source `BlockState` passed into `MultifaceSpreader.spreadAll`.
    97	/// This config is constructed fresh per call, and the source state is fixed for the
    98	/// duration of one `spreadAll`, so passing the already-known fact "is the source a vein"
    99	/// as a constructor argument is equivalent. Step 2 only ever drove this config from a
   100	/// real, already-placed `sculk_vein` block (`source_is_vein = true`); Step 3 adds the
